<div class="main-container">
  <header class="game-header">
    <h1 class="game-title">⚓ МОРСКОЙ БОЙ ⚓</h1>
    <p class="game-subtitle">Онлайн-стратегия на Ruby on Rails</p>
  </header>

  <main class="game-content">
    <% if @current_user %>
      <!-- Экран для авторизованного игрока -->
      <div class="profile-card">
        <h2 class="welcome-text">Добро пожаловать на борт, <span class="nickname"><%= @current_user.nickname %></span>!</h2>
        
        <div class="stats-box">
          <p>📊 Ваша статистика (Заглушка):</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Побед: <span class="stat-win">0</span></li>
            <li>Поражений: <span class="stat-lose">0</span></li>
            <li>Рейтинг: <span class="stat-rating">1000</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="action-zone">
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-large">🚀 НАЙТИ СОПЕРНИКА</button>
        </div>

        <div class="logout-zone">
          <form action="/session" method="post">
            <input type="hidden" name="_method" value="delete">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger">Выйти из рубки</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>

    <% else %>
      <!-- Экран для гостя -->
      <div class="guest-card">
        <p class="intro-text">
          Готовы принять командование флотом? Авторизуйтесь, чтобы начать сражение с реальными игроками по сети.
        </p>
        
        <div class="auth-buttons">
          <a href="/session/new" class="btn btn-primary">Войти в аккаунт</a>
          <a href="/register" class="btn btn-secondary">Регистрация игрока</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </main>

  <section class="ui-kit-battlefield" style="margin-top: 50px; border-top: 1px dashed #334155; padding-top: 30px;">
    <h3 style="color: #00f0ff; text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,240,255,0.4); margin-bottom: 5px;">🎮 ИГРОВОЙ UI KIT (БОЕВОЕ ПОЛЕ)</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 25px;">Прототип сетки 10х10, виды кораблей и спрайты попаданий</p>
    
    <div class="battlefield-demo-container" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 40px; align-items: flex-start;">
      
      <!-- Боевое поле 10х10 -->
      <div class="grid-wrapper">
        <h4 style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: #fff;">Морской квадрат 10 × 10</h4>
        <div class="sea-battle-grid">
          <!-- Буквенная строка координат -->
          <div class="coord"></div><div class="coord">А</div><div class="coord">Б</div><div class="coord">В</div><div class="coord">Г</div><div class="coord">Д</div><div class="coord">Е</div><div class="coord">Ж</div><div class="coord">З</div><div class="coord">И</div><div class="coord">К</div>
          
          <div class="coord">1</div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell cell-ship-part"></div><div class="game-cell cell-ship-part"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell cell-miss-dot"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div>
          <div class="coord">2</div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell cell-ship-single"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div>
          <div class="coord">3</div><div class="game-cell cell-ship-damaged"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div>
          <div class="coord">4</div><div class="game-cell cell-ship-sink"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div>
          <div class="coord">5</div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div>
          <div class="coord">6</div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div>
          <div class="coord">7</div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div>
          <div class="coord">8</div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div>
          <div class="coord">9</div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div>
          <div class="coord">10</div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div><div class="game-cell"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kit-specifications" style="text-align: left; max-width: 300px;">
        <h4 style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: #fff; text-align: center;">Виды кораблей и секций</h4>
        
        <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8;">1. Однопалубный катер (1 клетка):</p>
          <div class="game-cell cell-ship-single" style="width: 35px; height: 35px;"></div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8;">2. Двухпалубный эсминец (Секции корабля):</p>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 2px;">
            <div class="game-cell cell-ship-part" style="width: 35px; height: 35px;"></div>
            <div class="game-cell cell-ship-part" style="width: 35px; height: 35px;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8;">3. Спрайт "Взорванной" секции (Ранен):</p>
          <div class="game-cell cell-ship-damaged" style="width: 35px; height: 35px;"></div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8;">4. Уничтоженный корабль (Убит):</p>
          <div class="game-cell cell-ship-sink" style="width: 35px; height: 35px;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</div>